{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to find success in this divine mission? You and Mo, your moai pal , must reach the top of the Moai World before seven days pass to prevent its destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you fail, the world will reset, and you\u2019ll have to start from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So run, jump, and reach higher and higher places alongside Mo\u2014but be careful! A single wrong move could send you tumbling into the darkest depths of despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700970/extras/gif3.gif?t=1746176239\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo you can play the tutorial and the first area of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> We also included an area were you can talk wih npc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the base game de days limits for a restet are seven days but in the demo it's only three.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3700970?t=1746176239","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3700970?t=1746176239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700970/1d2f2522a1216fce7934821ef386d751bbdea48c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746176239","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700970/1d2f2522a1216fce7934821ef386d751bbdea48c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746176239","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to find success in this divine mission? You and Mo, your moai pal , must reach the top of the M